{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"excerpt":2,"tags":3,"film":13},"Grâce à Dieu (By the Grace of God)","Alexandre vit à Lyon avec sa femme et ses enfants. Un jour, il découvre par hasard que le prêtre qui a abusé de lui aux scouts officie toujours auprès d’enfants. Il se lance alors dans un combat, très vite rejoint par François et Emmanuel, également victimes du prêtre, pour « libérer leur parole » sur ce qu’ils ont subi. Mais les répercussions et conséquences de ces aveux ne laisseront personne indemne. (Alexandre lives in Lyon with his wife and children. One day he learns by chance that the priest who abused him when he was in scouts is still working with children. He decides to take action and is soon joined by two other victims of the priest, François and Emmanuel. They band together to ‵‵lift the burden of silence′′ surrounding their ordeal. But the repercussions and consequences will leave no one unscathed.)",[4,5,6,7,8,9,10,11,12],"religion","pedophilia","abuse","parenthood","power","state institutions","high rank employment","urban","marriage",{"type":14,"id":15,"slug":16,"title":17,"release":20,"filmType":24,"directors":25,"genre":58,"media":60,"synopsis":63,"production":66,"characters":72,"roles":73,"awards":154,"tags":3},"Film","FR2019_036","fr2019-036-grace-a-dieu",{"native":18,"english":19},"Grâce à Dieu","By the Grace of God",{"type":21,"date":22,"year":23},"Theatrical release","2019-02-20",2019,"Fiction film",[26],{"id":27,"slug":28,"name":27,"birthYear":29,"deathYear":30,"gender":31,"nationality":32,"awards":33},"François Ozon","francois-ozon",1967,0,"Male identifying","France",[34,43,49,52],{"film":35,"year":39,"award":40,"category":41,"result":42},{"slug":36,"title":37},"fr2020-045-ete-85",{"native":38},"Summer of 85",2020,"European Film Awards","Best Director","Nominated",{"film":44,"year":47,"award":48,"category":41,"result":42},{"slug":36,"title":45},{"native":46},"Été 85",2021,"César du cinéma",{"film":50,"year":39